    {
      "text": "Figure 9, 'Proof of Vaccination scenario: Manual Verification use case (UC004)'. The Figure 8 workflow with one path highlighted: the holder presents the DDCC:VS (1), the verifier receives the claim (2), no cryptographic verification is required, and the verifier goes directly to Point C, the decision on the claim. All the status-checking and PHA steps are greyed out.",
